  "observations": [
    "MALLET can report a missing CLI argument while returning exit code zero, so success validation also inspects diagnostics and required outputs.",
    "One transient Windows JShell/JDI local connection timeout was observed; the same deterministic command passed immediately afterward, and the wrappers now allow one narrowly matched retry.",
    "The fixture is intentionally small and demonstrates mechanics and reproducibility, not retrieval-quality superiority or production readiness.",
    "The final pair-level receipt used isolated CPython 3.12.13 from the exact package-local lock.",
    "The adversarial hardening pass binds one-read Tika snapshots, explicit MALLET classpaths, closed read-only trees, disjoint scratch, and atomic no-replace publication."
  ],
